{"path":"experimental/unique_resource/operator=","title":"std::experimental::unique_resource<R, D>::operator=","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::experimental::unique_resource&lt;R, D&gt;::</span>operator=","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/experimental/unique_resource/operator=","section":"experimental","kind":"page","summary":"Move assignment operator. Replaces the managed resource and the deleter with other's.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-libfund_ts_3\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">unique_resource<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> unique_resource<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> other <span class=\"br0\">)</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"coMULTI\">/*see below*/</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-libfund-ts-3 t-mark-ts\">(library fundamentals TS v3)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Move assignment operator. Replaces the managed resource and the deleter with <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code>'s.\n</p><p>Formally, let <code>RS</code> be the type of stored resource handle:\n</p>\n<ul><li> First, calls <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">reset<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> to dispose the currently owned resource, if any.\n</li><li> Then assigns the stored resource handle and the deleter with <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code>'s. <code>std::move</code> is applied to the stored resource handle or the deleter of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code> if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/is_move_assignable\"><span class=\"kw568\">std::<span class=\"me2\">is_nothrow_move_assignable_v</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>RS<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code> or <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/is_move_assignable\"><span class=\"kw568\">std::<span class=\"me2\">is_nothrow_move_assignable_v</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>D<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code> is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> respectively. Assignment of the stored resource handle is executed first, unless <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/is_move_assignable\"><span class=\"kw568\">std::<span class=\"me2\">is_nothrow_move_assignable_v</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>D<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code> is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/is_move_assignable\"><span class=\"kw568\">std::<span class=\"me2\">is_nothrow_move_assignable_v</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>RS<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code> is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code>.\n</li><li> Finally, sets <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> to own the resource if and only if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code> owned it before assignment, and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code> not to own the resource.\n</li></ul>\n<p>If <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/is_move_assignable\"><span class=\"kw568\">std::<span class=\"me2\">is_nothrow_move_assignable_v</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>RS<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code> is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code>, <code>RS</code> shall satisfy the <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/MoveAssignable\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">MoveAssignable</em></a> requirements; otherwise <code>RS</code> shall satisfy the <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/CopyAssignable\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">CopyAssignable</em></a> requirements. If <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/is_move_assignable\"><span class=\"kw568\">std::<span class=\"me2\">is_nothrow_move_assignable_v</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>D<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code> is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code>, <code>D</code> shall satisfy the <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/MoveAssignable\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">MoveAssignable</em></a> requirements; otherwise <code>D</code> shall satisfy the <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/CopyAssignable\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">CopyAssignable</em></a> requirements. Failing to satisfy above requirements results in undefined behavior.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> other\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> resource wrapper from which ownership will be transferred\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p>Any exception thrown in copy-assignment.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-noexcept-full\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/language/noexcept_spec\"><code>noexcept</code></a> specification:&nbsp;&nbsp;\n<div class=\"t-noexcept-box\"><span class=\"t-cc\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/is_move_assignable\"><span class=\"kw568\">std::<span class=\"me2\">is_nothrow_move_assignable_v</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>RS<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/types/is_move_assignable\"><span class=\"kw568\">std::<span class=\"me2\">is_nothrow_move_assignable_v</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>D<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></span></div></div>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>If a copy of a member throws an exception, this mechanism leaves <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code> intact and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> in the released state.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete<br>Reason: no example </div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/unique_resource/reset\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>reset</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  disposes or replaces the managed resource <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/unique_ptr/operator=\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator=</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  assigns the <code>unique_ptr</code> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::unique_ptr&lt;T,Deleter&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"experimental","title":"Experimental C++ Features"},{"path":"experimental/unique_resource","title":"std::experimental::unique_resource"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::experimental::unique_resource<R, D>::operator=","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Move assignment operator. Replaces the managed resource and the deleter with other's."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"other"},{"label":"Return value","note":"*this"},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"Any exception thrown in copy-assignment."},{"label":"Notes","note":"If a copy of a member throws an exception, this mechanism leaves other intact and *this in the released state."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"reset","note":"disposes or replaces the managed resource"},{"label":"operator=","note":"assigns the unique_ptr"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":232,"codeBlockCount":0}
